  "editorial": {
    "name": "constructive-io/constructive",
    "descriptionZh": "给团队用的 Postgres 工具链，About 一句话写 Secure, Modular Postgres for Teams。仓库把 pgpm、graphile、graphql、postgres、sdk 拆成一堆包，CI 里跑迁移与发布，最新一条提交是 chore(release): publish。",
    "takeawayZh": "一套 Postgres 迁移与发布工具链的包划分",
    "noteZh": "About 栏写 Secure, Modular Postgres for Teams，挂着 constructive.io 外链与 MIT license。文件树里是 packages、pgpm、graphile、graphql、postgres、sdk、types、scripts、docker、docs、examples、agentic 等目录，根目录另有 Makefile、Dockerfile、AGENTS.md、CLAUDE.md、QUICKSTART.md、ROLES.md、PUBLISH.md、DEVELOPMENT.md 一堆文档。提交信息能看到 feat(cli): separate cnc and pgpm CLIs - hard separation、chore(ci): batch unit tests, add timeouts, optimize Dockerfile、ci: remove MinIO defaults in favor of RustFS。规模是 7,705 Commits、561 Branches、19,132 Tags、53 Stars、54 Contributors，顶部最新一条是 pyramation 的 chore(release): publish。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
